# Ruby Conventions

- **Kwargs always.** Exception: single obvious arg (`def find(id)`).
- **Method names:** verbs, spelled out, concise. No `calc`, `proc`, `get_`.
- **Variable names:** spelled out. Only loop iterators may be single-letter.

```ruby
# ❌ BAD
def calc_tot(usr, qty); end
calc_tot(u, 3)

# ✅ GOOD
def calculate_total(user:, quantity:); end
calculate_total(user: user, quantity: 3)
```
